OL,3,GNEWSA'AI helped diagnose my daughter's
OL,4,Arare condition'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a 19-month-old girl with
OL,7,Fa rare genetic condition affecting only
OL,8,Fsix people in the UK say AI helped them
OL,9,Fto gain a diagnosis.
OL,11,FLily, from Bath, had surgery for an
OL,12,Funknown heart condition at four months
OL,13,Fold. In January tests finally revealed
OL,14,Fshe has Multisystemic Smooth Muscle
OL,15,FDysfunction Syndrome (MSMDS).
OL,17,FHer mum, Rosie, said she put Lily's
OL,18,Fsymptoms into ChatGPT, which came up
OL,19,Fwith MSMDS, but when she told doctors,
OL,20,F"some of them had never heard of it;
OL,21,Fothers said it is so rare it's very
OL,22,Funlikely".
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
